  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 653 days before the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D7"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the ketorolac tromethamine shortage on 2018-03-23 and it remains current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E46", "D20"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hospira, Inc. (FEI 1925262) is a registered plant on the product label and has an OAI inspection that ended 2016-06-08, 653 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["E19", "E25", "D7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to the same plant on 2017-02-14, 402 days before the posting.",
      "cites": ["E30", "D8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Another OAI inspection at that plant ended 2018-08-15, with its classification letter dated 2020-04-22, 145 days after the posting.",
      "cites": ["E27", "D12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Baxter Healthcare and Fresenius Kabi also appear on FDA's shortage list with current status and estimated recoveries in late 2026.",
      "cites": ["E39", "E40"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule‑ranked alternate is to buy from A‑S Medication Solutions, which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D17"]
    }
  ]
}
